---

# Authentication Flow

```text
React Frontend
      ↓
Login Request
      ↓
FastAPI Backend
      ↓
Verify Credentials
      ↓
Generate JWT Token
      ↓
Store Token in localStorage
      ↓
Frontend Sends Token
      ↓
Protected Route Access
```

---

# API Endpoints

## Signup

```http
POST /signup
```

### Request Body

```json
{
  "fullName": "Priyansh",
  "email": "test@gmail.com",
  "password": "123456"
}
```

---

## Login

```http
POST /login
```

### Response

```json
{
  "access_token": "jwt_token_here",
  "token_type": "bearer"
}
```

---

## Protected Route

```http
GET /protected
```

### Authorization Header

```http
Authorization: Bearer <token>
```

---

# Installation

## Clone Repository

```bash
git clone <repository-url>
```

---

# Frontend Setup

```bash
cd frontend

npm install

npm run dev
```

---

# Backend Setup

## Create Virtual Environment

```bash
python -m venv venv
```

## Activate Virtual Environment

### Windows

```bash
venv\Scripts\activate
```

### Linux / Mac

```bash
source venv/bin/activate
```

---

## Install Dependencies

```bash
pip install fastapi uvicorn sqlalchemy python-jose passlib[bcrypt] bcrypt==4.0.1 python-dotenv
```

---

## Run Backend

```bash
uvicorn main:app --reload
```

---

# Database

This project uses:
- SQLite
- SQLAlchemy ORM

User data is stored in:

```bash
auth.db
```

